  "name": "Baked Falafel with Cauliflower Tabbouleh and Avocado-Pea Feta Smash",
  "subtitle": "Crisp chickpea falafel with herbed cauliflower and a creamy pea topping",
  "description": "Bake spiced chickpea falafel alongside cumin-roasted cauliflower, then serve with lemony herbs, rocket, and a pea, avocado, and feta smash.",
